{"id": "b49f05fb-61de-4297-af13-f708481189f5", "slug": "luma-3d-masterclasses", "title": "LUMA | 3D Masterclasses", "description": "Masterclasses Luma Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"LUMA | 3D Masterclasses\"\ndescription: \"Masterclasses Luma Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4A90E2\"\n  secondary: \"#0B0C15\"\n  accent: \"#F5A623\"\n  background: \"#0B0C15\"\n  surface: \"#141932\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# LUMA | 3D Masterclasses\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 2; favorites: 1; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, css, interactive, plans, billing, conversion.\n## Overview\nMasterclasses Luma Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nL M A WORKSHOPS TUTORIALS PRICING 02 Evolution of Form Elevate Master procedural generation, advanced physics simulations, and high-fidelity rendering pipelines. FULL TRAILER SIMULATION MOTION DESIGN 3D MODELING Next Le…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Evolution of Form; Elevate; Next Level Fidelity; Push the boundaries of real-time rendering..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4A90E2, secondary #0B0C15, accent #F5A623, background #0B0C15, surface #141932, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>LUMA | 3D Masterclasses</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n        /* Masked reveal utilities */\n        .clip-mask {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            vertical-align: bottom;\n        }\n        .clip-inner {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(120%);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom scrollbar for premium feel */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #0B0C15;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0B0C15] text-white font-['Inter',sans-serif] min-h-screen relative antialiased selection:bg-[#4A90E2]/30 selection:text-white overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></div>\n\n    <!-- UI Overlay container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex flex-col min-h-screen\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 50%, rgba(20, 25, 50, 0.4) 0%, rgba(11, 12, 21, 0.9) 100%);\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 md:px-12 py-8 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto w-full opacity-0\" id=\"nav-header\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-xs\">\n                L\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#4A90E2] animate-pulse\"></div>\n                </div>\n                M A\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-16 text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white/50 font-medium\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">WORKSHOPS</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">TUTORIALS</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">PRICING</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <button class=\"text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Subtle Grid Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-center opacity-20\">\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent mx-[20%] hidden lg:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent mx-[20%] hidden lg:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Hero Content -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex items-center relative px-6 md:px-12 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto w-full pb-20 pt-10\">\n\n            <!-- Left Controls -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-6 absolute left-12 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20\">\n                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all backdrop-blur-sm bg-white/5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-left-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-6 absolute left-32 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20\">\n                <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white/90\">02</span>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-[2px] bg-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-[2px] bg-[#F5A623] rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-[2px] bg-[#4A90E2] rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Social Links Right -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-8 absolute right-12 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-white/40 z-20\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#4A90E2] transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:twitter-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-stream-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-f-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Center Typography area -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex justify-end lg:pr-[15%]\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-2xl w-full\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-white/60 mb-6 uppercase reveal-element font-medium\">Evolution of Form</h2>\n\n                    <!-- Masked Title Reveal -->\n                    <h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] mb-10 uppercase text-shadow-sm masked-text-stagger\">\n                        Elevate\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-5 mb-8 reveal-element\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 text-white/80\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lightbulb-bolt-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 text-white/80\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:monitor-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 text-white/80\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gamepad-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-white/50 max-w-md leading-relaxed reveal-element\">\n                        Master procedural generation, advanced physics simulations, and high-fidelity rendering pipelines.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Control -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex absolute right-[25%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20\">\n                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all backdrop-blur-sm bg-white/5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer / Tags -->\n        <footer class=\"mt-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-10 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8 z-20 reveal-element\">\n\n            <!-- Gradient Border Button -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white/30 via-white/5 to-white/30 p-[1px] cursor-pointer group\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0B0C15]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#0B0C15]/70\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"text-[#F5A623]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] text-white/90\">FULL TRAILER</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Tags -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-full border border-white/5 px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 backdrop-blur-md bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F5A623]\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] text-white/60\">SIMULATION</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"rounded-full border border-white/5 px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 backdrop-blur-md bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#4A90E2]\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] text-white/60\">MOTION DESIGN</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"rounded-full border border-white/5 px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 backdrop-blur-md bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] text-white/60\">3D MODELING</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scroll Section to demonstrate ScrollTrigger -->\n    <section class=\"relative z-10 min-h-[70vh] w-full bg-[#0B0C15] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-24 border-t border-white/5\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-4xl text-center\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#4A90E2] mb-6 uppercase font-medium scroll-reveal-fade\">Next Level Fidelity</h3>\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-8 scroll-masked-text\">\n                Push the boundaries of real-time rendering.\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-lg text-white/50 max-w-2xl mx-auto scroll-reveal-fade leading-relaxed\">\n                Join our comprehensive workshops and learn the exact techniques industry professionals use to create stunning, physics-based animations directly in the browser.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from 'https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js';\n\n        // --- GSAP Setup & Masked Reveals ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Helper: Wrap words in mask spans\n        function wrapWords(selector) {\n            document.querySelectorAll(selector).forEach(el => {\n                const words = el.innerText.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const mask = document.createElement('span');\n                    mask.className = 'clip-mask mr-[0.2em]'; // slight margin between words\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'clip-inner';\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    mask.appendChild(inner);\n                    el.appendChild(mask);\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        wrapWords('.masked-text-stagger');\n        wrapWords('.scroll-masked-text');\n\n        // Initial Load Timeline\n        const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power4.out' } });\n\n        tl.to('#nav-header', { opacity: 1, duration: 1, y: 0, clearProps: 'all' })\n          .to('.masked-text-stagger .clip-inner', {\n              y: '0%',\n              duration: 1.2,\n              stagger: 0.15\n          }, \"-=0.5\")\n          .fromTo('.reveal-element',\n              { opacity: 0, y: 20 },\n              { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1 },\n          \"-=0.8\")\n          .to('#webgl-canvas', { opacity: 1, duration: 2 }, \"-=1.5\");\n\n\n        // ScrollTrigger Animations\n        gsap.to('.scroll-masked-text .clip-inner', {\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: '.scroll-masked-text',\n                start: \"top 80%\",\n            },\n            y: '0%',\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.1,\n            ease: 'power4.out'\n        });\n\n        gsap.fromTo('.scroll-reveal-fade',\n            { opacity: 0, y: 30 },\n            {\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.scroll-masked-text',\n                    start: \"top 70%\",\n                },\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                ease: 'power3.out'\n            }\n        );\n\n        // --- Three.js Setup ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n        // Position camera slightly to the right to frame the composition\n        camera.position.set(-3, 0, 22);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Lighting\n        const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.6);\n        scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n        const dirLight1 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x88bbff, 3);\n        dirLight1.position.set(10, 10, 10);\n        scene.add(dirLight1);\n\n        const dirLight2 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffaa88, 1);\n        dirLight2.position.set(-10, -5, -5);\n        scene.add(dirLight2);\n\n        const pointLight = new THREE.PointLight(0x4A90E2, 50, 20);\n        pointLight.position.set(0, 0, 5);\n        scene.add(pointLight);\n\n        // Materials formulation to mimic reference\n        const matNavy = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n            color: 0x141830, roughness: 0.4, metalness: 0.1, clearcoat: 0.2\n        });\n        const matMetallic = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n            color: 0x2A6B9C, roughness: 0.15, metalness: 0.8, clearcoat: 1.0\n        });\n        const matDarkGloss = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n            color: 0x080A12, roughness: 0.1, metalness: 0.5, clearcoat: 0.5\n        });\n        // Simulating the gold particle interior by using a solid textured gold exterior\n        const matGold = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n            color: 0xD4AF37, roughness: 0.3, metalness: 1.0\n        });\n\n        const materials = [matNavy, matNavy, matMetallic, matDarkGloss, matGold];\n\n        // Cluster Generation\n        const clusterGroup = new THREE.Group();\n        // Shift cluster left to balance text on right\n        clusterGroup.position.x = -4;\n        scene.add(clusterGroup);\n\n        const numSpheres = 65;\n        const mainRadius = 5.5;\n        const tubeRadius = 2.5;\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < numSpheres; i++) {\n            // Torus distribution math\n            const u = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n            const v = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n\n            // Add volume/scatter\n            const scatterX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.5;\n            const scatterY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.5;\n            const scatterZ = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.5;\n\n            const x = (mainRadius + tubeRadius * Math.cos(v)) * Math.cos(u) + scatterX;\n            const y = (mainRadius + tubeRadius * Math.cos(v)) * Math.sin(u) + scatterY;\n            const z = tubeRadius * Math.sin(v) + scatterZ;\n\n            // Varied sizing\n            let size = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.8;\n            // Occasional large spheres\n            if(Math.random() > 0.85) size *= 1.8;\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(size, 32, 32);\n\n            // Bias towards navy color\n            let matIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * materials.length);\n            if(Math.random() > 0.4) matIndex = 0; // Force Navy often\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, materials[matIndex]);\n            mesh.position.set(x, y, z);\n\n            // Random initial rotation for visual variance if geometry wasn't uniform\n            mesh.rotation.set(Math.random() * Math.PI, Math.random() * Math.PI, 0);\n\n            clusterGroup.add(mesh);\n        }\n\n        // Mouse Parallax Effect\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n        const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n        });\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Rotate entire cluster slowly\n            clusterGroup.rotation.y = time * 0.05;\n            clusterGroup.rotation.x = Math.sin(time * 0.05) * 0.2;\n            clusterGroup.rotation.z = Math.cos(time * 0.05) * 0.1;\n\n            // Gentle individual sphere pulsing/floating\n            clusterGroup.children.forEach((child, i) => {\n                child.position.y += Math.sin(time * 1.5 + i) * 0.003;\n            });\n\n            // Smooth mouse parallax\n            targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n            targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n\n            clusterGroup.position.x += ((-targetX - 4) - clusterGroup.position.x) * 0.05;\n            clusterGroup.position.y += (-targetY - clusterGroup.position.y) * 0.05;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n\n        // Responsive handling\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "luma-3d-masterclasses.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/luma-3d-masterclasses.jpg", "source_name": "luma-3d-masterclasses-DESIGN.md", "views": 107, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T19:59:35.248747+00:00"}